sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Job as Recommendation Job
  participant Ai as AiRecommendationService
  participant Analytics as AnalyticsSnapshotRepository
  participant Model as AiModelVersionRepository
  participant Repo as RecommendationRepository
  actor Student
  participant Api as RecommendationController

  Job->>Ai: generateRecommendations()
  Ai->>Model: Load active model version
  Ai->>Analytics: Read learning snapshots and signals
  Ai->>Ai: Rank recommended learning items
  Ai->>Repo: Save recommendation items and reasons
  Student->>Api: GET /api/v1/me/recommendations
  Api->>Ai: listForStudent(studentId)
  Ai->>Repo: Load latest active recommendations
  Ai-->>Api: RecommendationResponse
  Api-->>Student: 200 OK or Vietnamese empty state
